  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme of emergency assistance for Gaza (Education)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">At its 42nd session, the General Conference adopted 42 C/Resolution 54, which calls upon UNESCO to prepare &#x201C;a programme of emergency assistance for Gaza including an Action Plan with immediate implementation&#x201D;, to establish a &#x201C;special account for voluntary contributions, in conformity with the financial regulations of UNESCO, for the reconstruction of Gaza in its field of competence&#x201D;. This Element concerns the Education component of this programme.</narrative>
